<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 6/9.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 6/9.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, June 9 on Friday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   09.06.97	  06.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5224	    6.5276</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3095	    2.3190</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5038	    4.5266</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4560	    3.4496</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5146	    0.5163</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7691	    0.7725</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2887	    0.2899</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9692	    6.9985</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6938	    0.6937	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2374	    1.2403</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
